  "title": "Herbed Scalloped Potatoes and Onions",
  "description": "These herbed scallop potatoes with onion are extra creamy with the addition of mayo. Start them in the morning, then bake later in time for dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "Autumn Pumpkin"
  ],
